# mcp-jev environment

Required to actually invoke the jev model:

JEV_ENDPOINT=https://inference-api.nousresearch.com/v1/chat/completions
JEV_MODEL=jev-token-guard-v0
JEV_API_KEY=<your-token>

To enable the MCP tool path in the plugin (JEV_MCP=1), the plugin's cap
function will, on results >6 KB, hand the spilled text to the agent which
calls `jev_summarize` instead of slicing. Off by default (slicing is cheaper).
